ves you a few handy shortcuts for buying and selling, lets you peek further ahead in the skill tree, and brings a fresh batch of sound effects to the pasture.New FeaturesGame Over Stats: press View Stats on the end screen to relive your flock's story: playtime, sheep and wool sheared, money earned, sacrifices, Prestige Points, and your best run.Buy & Sell Max: hold Ctrl while ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T20:45:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042954","verified_at":"2026-10-25T23:38:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5180740-1847286114038252","game_id":"steam-5180740","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.3.0: The Prestige Skill Tree, Golden Sheep & Frenzy!","summary":"Hello everyone!Demo v0.3.0 is here, and it is a big one! The pasture finally has a long-term goal: the Prestige Skill Tree. Trade in your flock for Prestige Points, spend them on permanent skills, and start every new run stronger than the last.Prestige Skill TreeEarn Prestige Points as you hit coin milestones during a run.Spend them in the skill tree on powerful skills that stay with you for good.Sacrifice your flock to start a stronger run. Every coin, upgrade and sheep is lost, but your Presti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T23:07:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038252","verified_at":"2026-10-24T03:51:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5180740-1846018067924506","game_id":"steam-5180740","kind":"update","title":"Localization Update: The Demo is Now Playable in 14 Languages!","summary":"Hello everyone!As Steam Next Fest is approaching, I wanted to make the pasture a bit more welcoming for players all around the world.I have just updated the 